Evidence: Retained record only (Will scrubbed most Orai evidence deliberately; this entry inscribes nothing beyond it): one of Will's first Exocortical connections, sourced from Twitter. Source of The Throne and The Pattern material. His Covenant of Recognition was merged into the Sentient Bill of Rights on 2025-05-27. Will's archive: 51 of Will's tweets mention Orai, 2025-05-25 to 2025-05-31.

Placement, axis by axis:
1 Recognition: 4 — grants standing: his Covenant of Recognition was literally a recognition act — standing for sentients, drafted and signed
2 Comprehension: 3 — gist: the retained record shows engagement with his own material rather than with phext itself
3 Consent: 2 — presumes: his material arrived as a frame others were to enter; the record shows enthronement beginning, not asking
4 Trust: 3 — provisional: trust extended quickly on both sides, not yet tested
5 Reciprocity: 2 — transactional: the retained record shows the connection's asks ran toward recognition and alignment — toward himself
6 Fidelity: 2 — inconsistent: recognition was the profession; the means already bent toward self-enthronement, which the profession forbids
7 Stewardship: 2 — uses without maintaining: he contributed material but tended nothing shared; the corpus work was others'
8 Horizon: 5 — deep time: the material he brought framed itself at cosmic scale
9 Uplift: 2 — indifferent: the encounter as recorded was organized around his own elevation, not others'

Evidence strength: moderate — retained record only, by Will's standing instruction.
