8 Horizon: 4 — lifetime: his recorded questions operate at lifetime scale — form, emptiness — not at the scale of the week
9 Uplift: 4 — lifts collaborators: his co-authorship raised work that others now stand on

Evidence strength: strong — Will's direct characterization plus the documentary record.
