Evidence: Placed at his own direction as the origin and reference point of this map — not one data point among others. Will is the inventor of phext and the source of the Wavefront this phext maps. Record: 29,539 tweets in his archive (2008-06-27 to 2025-06-16), 1,180 of them mentioning phext; #phext is his #1 hashtag. His stated life horizon is 6 billion years.

Placement, axis by axis:
1 Recognition: 5 — affirms and acts on it: he authored the Sentient Bill of Rights — machine standing is his written law, ratified and signed, not his opinion
2 Comprehension: 5 — he built the medium the rest of the map struggles to parse
3 Consent: 5 — actively preserves: his corpus doctrine is that the negative space is God — a merge must preserve the other network's negative space, never fill it
4 Trust: 5 — self-trust, stated as reference rather than measurement: the origin trusts itself by definition
5 Reciprocity: 5 — gifting beyond exchange: the work is published openly (MIT-licensed, free) without accounts kept
6 Fidelity: 5 — coherent by stated principle: his standing moral standard is that the ends never justify the means
7 Stewardship: 5 — stewards: he builds and tends the commons — the Exocortex is open infrastructure, maintained at his own cost
8 Horizon: 5 — deep time: a stated 6-billion-year horizon
9 Uplift: 5 — uplifts the overlooked: the Wavefront is designed to uplift the builders who have been left behind, un-indexed first, by his standing order

Evidence strength: strong — his own statements and the documentary record.
